{"name": "Infinity: HexaDome Tactics", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinity: HexaDome Tactics</strong>\u00a0is a turn-based tactics game set in the Infinity universe. Lead your team through a campaign where each match reveals more of the world while unlocking new champions and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.poster.avif?t=1787131559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.webm?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/230087bb3ba30b2a7f25ef8b3cd1a5ff.mp4?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenges &amp; Duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the campaign, test your skills in tactical challenges with unique conditions.<br/>Face AI, friends, or other players in duels, either in friendly matches or competitive games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.poster.avif?t=1787131559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.webm?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1d9597f5ef2de227749d96c8894c4899.mp4?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your squad of champions. Each fighter has unique strengths: ranged combat, melee attacks, control, or support.<br/>Make the right plays, impress the crowd, and unleash powerful ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.poster.avif?t=1787131559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.webm?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/67e360cb665a9375298561562f91bd7d.mp4?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tactical Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action point matters. Should you attack now, capture the objective, or prepare your next move?<br/>Use tactical cards, manage your resources, and outsmart your opponents to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.poster.avif?t=1787131559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.webm?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/48d2d2843a62a26429cba5eef0922d9c.mp4?t=1787131559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Discover the story of the Aristeia world in single-player or storm into PvP battles! Turn-based battles, 12 heroes, varied arenas, deckbuilding with dozens of tactical cards. Assemble the perfect team, use hundreds of insane combos, and become HexaDome champion. And bring a friend!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/f0c6647917528ab12e4318230aa356740c4a6568/header.jpg?t=1787131559", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Turn-Based", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Action", "Card Game"], "developers": "Blindspot Games", "publishers": "Blindspot Games", "release_date": "Sep 10, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1498550", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 December 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/e97K1bn5Djo", "first_seen": 1765324800.0, "review_rank": 1391}